SUMMARY:Idea to Merge with the Copilot App
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nYou are onboarding your team to the
  GitHub Copilot App.\n\nTo prove it can drive real delivery\, you install 
 the app\, use chat to open a work item\, run an issue-driven session to bu
 ild a small bookmarks site that stores each original URL alongside a local
 ly generated short slug\, ship it through a pull request\, merge it\, and 
 preview the result in a canvas — all without leaving the app.\n\n[Dig in
 to the repo](https://aka.ms/Idea/Merge-GH)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3158
 65160/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260727T212354Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260727T212354Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
