DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260805T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260805T130000
SUMMARY:Building secure access in OneLake with roles\, endpoints and data 
 controls
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThis session explains how secure ac
 cess is built and managed in OneLake. It covers an overview of OneLake sec
 urity\, the data access control model\, creating and managing roles\, SQL 
 analytics endpoint security\, and granular controls for tables\, folders\,
  columns\, and rows. The goal is to give attendees a clear understanding o
 f how these settings fit together so they can configure access more confid
 ently and avoid common issues when securing data in Fabric.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3152
 00929/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260610T175530Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T175530Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Microsoft Reactor Toronto
UID:event_315376691@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260801T035236Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T120000
SUMMARY:Get Certified: (Exam Day) What to Expect and How to Pass (US/EMEA)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nGetting ready for exam day? This se
 ssion is all about helping you walk in prepared and walk out confident.\n\
 nWe will break down what the exams are really like\, including the types o
 f questions you will see\, how they are structured\, and what can catch pe
 ople off guard. You will hear directly from people who have taken and pass
 ed these exams\, so you get real insight into what works and what does not
 .\n\nWe will also share practical strategies for studying\, managing your 
 time during the exam\, and staying focused when it counts. Whether you are
  just starting your prep or getting close to test day\, this session will 
 help you feel ready.\n\nPre-requisites:\nJoin Data Days: https://aka.ms/da
 tadays\nFind a study group: https://aka.ms/dd/studygroup\nRequest a free e
 xam voucher: https://aka.ms/dd/cert
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3153
 76691/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260622T233829Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260622T233829Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
